   :rows
   ((:feature "The normative standard in standard/, a conformance vector per section" :cells (y y y) :evidence "Linux, macOS, Windows: ci.yml runs ./bin/test and ./bin/functional on the Linux, macOS and Windows legs on every push, green on all three in run 39271096164; 61c0e67 skeleton and tools/conformance/check_rn_standard.py; one change per section, each with its vectors (standard_wire_primitives_vectors 062e2cb through standard_channels_receipts_security_vectors 263a088); standard/RATIONALE.md 3ba4ff2")
    (:feature "Section t6: connect token" :cells (y y y) :evidence "Linux, macOS, Windows: landed as 192db19; its cases run in the unit and functional suites ci.yml runs on all three on every push, green on all three in run 39271096164")
    (:feature "Section t7: key schedule" :cells (y y y) :evidence "Linux, macOS, Windows: landed as 1701719; its cases run in the unit and functional suites ci.yml runs on all three on every push, green on all three in run 39271096164")
    (:feature "Section t8: packet formats" :cells (y y y) :evidence "Linux, macOS, Windows: landed as 94331b6; its cases run in the unit and functional suites ci.yml runs on all three on every push, green on all three in run 39271096164")
    (:feature "Section t9: packet protection" :cells (y y y) :evidence "Linux, macOS, Windows: landed as 1f75abd; its cases run in the unit and functional suites ci.yml runs on all three on every push, green on all three in run 39271096164")
    (:feature "Section t11: handshake, the client" :cells (y y y) :evidence "Linux, macOS, Windows: landed as 3c314a9; its cases run in the unit and functional suites ci.yml runs on all three on every push, green on all three in run 39271096164")
    (:feature "Section t12: handshake, the server" :cells (y y y) :evidence "Linux, macOS, Windows: landed as 17fb384; its cases run in the unit and functional suites ci.yml runs on all three on every push, green on all three in run 39271096164")
    (:feature "Section t13: session: keep-alive, timeout, disconnect, slot reset" :cells (y y y) :evidence "Linux, macOS, Windows: landed as 6595114; its cases run in the unit and functional suites ci.yml runs on all three on every push, green on all three in run 39271096164")
    (:feature "Section t14: replay protection" :cells (y y y) :evidence "Linux, macOS, Windows: landed as 37885ea; its cases run in the unit and functional suites ci.yml runs on all three on every push, green on all three in run 39271096164")
    (:feature "Section m4: receiver checks" :cells (y y y) :evidence "Linux, macOS, Windows: landed as 601c397; its cases run in the unit and functional suites ci.yml runs on all three on every push, green on all three in run 39271096164")
    (:feature "Section m8: blocks" :cells (y y y) :evidence "Linux, macOS, Windows: landed as 96845d6; its cases run in the unit and functional suites ci.yml runs on all three on every push, green on all three in run 39271096164")
